UID:2026-11-07-walter-parks-the-unlawful-assembly-the-magnif-9385c07@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261030T000614Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T190000
SUMMARY:Walter Parks & The Unlawful Assembly The Magnificent Quartet Returns!
DESCRIPTION:Walter Parks & The Unlawful Assembly The Magnificent Quartet Returns! Sat\, Nov 7\, 20 26 7:00pm Walter Parks and The Unlawful Assembly return to the Fallout Shelter after a brilliant February debut that wowed the room with reimagined spirituals and hymns. Longtime sideman to Woodstock legend Richie Havens\, Parks leads a band featuring vocalist Ada Dyer\, currently touring the world alongside Bruce Springsteen\, drummer Steven Williams\, and Etienne Lytle on keys. Gospel\, blues\, and prison work songs\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875971/WALTER-PARKS-AND-THE-UNLAWFUL-ASSEMBLY
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875971/WALTER-PARKS-AND-THE-UNLAWFUL-ASSEMBLY
END:VEVENT
