DESCRIPTION:A combination of tennis\, badminton\, ping pong and racquetball - one of the fastest growing sports in America! A few racquets and balls are available for newcomers. Participants must help set up and break down at the end of each class. Drop in style pickleball - players of all skill levels and ages are welcome to join. Friday mornings from 8:00am-10:00am Civic Center Gym Drop-In Fee: Res: $5.00/NR: $7.00 Schedule is subject to change\, please call ahead. 781-762-0466. Closed on holidays and school vacation weeks!\nCost: $5.00 Res\, $7.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30942
URL:https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30942
END:VEVENT
